      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly, the issue isn't with the button itself, it's with the placement. You can tell what kind of intent they had with this. Instead of putting it all the way on the left/right, they put it right in between the launch pad and notifications. Instead of people going like, oo what's this new tab here, oh vrc+! cool! I might sub to that-\n\nThey will keep missclicking it and being like wtf is this? and complain. And in turn make the experience of VRC worse. You think this makes people sub to VRC+ more? Give it more features and don't shove it in our faces with predatory behaviour like this. Be fair to us, don't take advantage of us, it's disgusting. This is why people now completely block ads on YouTube, instead of buying YouTube Premium. Don't make the experience worse for the users, make it better for the ones that are loyal and want to support you, instead of forcing the people that enjoy your platform to buy your subs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
