      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for all the feedback in the replies to this comment!\n\nFor the moment, we plan on rolling with the new position next to the Settings menu. We'll be watching our metrics to see if it fulfills the goals set out by this change, as well as making sure it doesn't disrupt typical usage of VRChat.\n\nIf we see that it isn't accomplishing what we want it to do, we'll iterate further.",
